### Run artefacts — regenerated by every run, and large
# Screenshots alone reached 67MB, which is not something to carry in history.
Reports/
Screenshots/

# LibreOffice leaves these beside a spreadsheet while it is open.
.~lock.*#

### The captcha OCR tool
# Captcha/ is committed so a clone is self-contained: config.properties points at
# Captcha/ocr.py and every AUTO captcha row depends on it. It carries a vendored ddddocr,
# whose common.onnx is 51MB - over GitHub's large file warning threshold, though under the
# 100MB limit that would block a push outright.
#
# Its own .git was renamed to .git.disabled so git tracks the files rather than recording a
# gitlink, which would leave a clone with an empty folder.
Captcha/**/__pycache__/
Captcha/.git.disabled/
*.pyc
